---
/**
 * Wrapper for a pattern's authoring residue — the `## To-do` section, which
 * integrations/remark-consequences.ts lifts out of wherever it was authored
 * and re-emits after the page foot. Rendered in the code face, small and
 * dimmed, so it reads as notes to self rather than as part of the pattern.
 *
 * data-toc-ignore keeps its heading out of "On this page"; data-pagefind-ignore
 * keeps a to-do item from becoming a search hit.
 */
---
<aside class="residue flow" data-toc-ignore data-pagefind-ignore>
  <slot />
</aside>
